# One runnable app

The only user-facing build is:

`E:\Work\OmniCam\dist\CabinetNC-Cut\CabinetNC.Desktop.exe`

Desktop icon `OmniCam` and `OmniCam.cmd` start that folder.

Do not create extra copies (`dist\CabinetNC-Cut-fd*`, `*-stage4`, `*-next`, `*-old`, `*-win-x64`). After Desktop/Domain changes, `dotnet build -c Release` the Desktop project; PostBuild copies into `dist\CabinetNC-Cut`. If copy fails, the app is open — close it and rebuild. Tell the user to reopen from the desktop icon.
